  "description": "Gyani Maiya Sen-Kusunda (1937–2020), a Kusunda elder from Dang, Nepal, talks with Uday Raj Aaley about the endangerment of Kusunda, her first language. Subhashish Panigrahi recorded it in 2018 for his 2019 documentary Gyani Maiya. Panigrahi edited unused or trimmed footage from the film and published it under the Gejmehac Gipan project in 2025. Kusunda and Nepali subtitles are by Aaley, and the English translation is by Sanjib Chaudhary and Panigrahi.",
